      "inherent_risk": "critical",
      "residual_risk": "high",
      "residual_rationale": "The approval gate provides only a model summary via collapsed arguments and suffers from high volume approval fatigue, earning only 1 tier of credit, capping mitigation and leaving residual risk at high.",
